---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Argha Ray — full-stack engineer at Motorola Solutions"
	pubDate={new Date('March 30 2026')}
>
	<p>
		I'm a full-stack engineer with 9+ years of experience building enterprise systems. Currently at
		<strong>Motorola Solutions</strong> in Bangalore, working on authorization services, deployment
		automation, and cross-platform communication platforms.
	</p>

	<h3>At work</h3>
	<p>
		I've built an authorization service handling role-based permissions for thousands of users (Java 17,
		Spring Boot, PostgreSQL), a 2,100-line deployment tool used by 28+ developers, and contributed to
		telecom platforms with 90+ entity models and Okta authentication. I also run internal workshops on
		agentic engineering and have designed 15 AI agent blueprints for workflow automation.
	</p>

	<h3>Side projects</h3>
	<p>
		I'm building <a href="https://github.com/golden-screen">Globo</a> — a TVOD streaming platform
		for the South Indian diaspora (NestJS + React 19). I recently modernized my
		<a href="https://github.com/ArghaRay00/OnlineExam">OnlineExam</a> project from .NET Framework 4.5.1
		to .NET 9 with Clean Architecture. And I'm researching systematic trading systems for Indian markets.
	</p>

	<h3>Tech I work with</h3>
	<p>
		<strong>Languages:</strong> Java, C#, TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, Bash, Go<br/>
		<strong>Backend:</strong> Spring Boot, ASP.NET Core 9, NestJS, Express, Carter, MediatR<br/>
		<strong>Frontend:</strong> Angular, React, Tailwind, Angular Material<br/>
		<strong>Data:</strong> PostgreSQL, MongoDB, MySQL, SQL Server, Redis, DynamoDB<br/>
		<strong>Cloud:</strong> AWS (Lambda, IoT Core, CloudWatch), Azure DevOps, Docker, Cloudflare
	</p>

	<h3>This site</h3>
	<p>
		Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, deployed on
		<a href="https://pages.cloudflare.com">Cloudflare Pages</a>. I write about what I'm building,
		technical decisions I make, and things I learn along the way.
	</p>

	<h3>Find me</h3>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="https://github.com/ArghaRay00">GitHub</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://x.com/argharay94">X / Twitter</a></li>
	</ul>
</Layout>
